    <body>
      <div type="clause">
        <head>Cn 1018</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Fulgeorne hi witan þæt hi nagan mid rihte þurh hæmedþingc. wifes gemánan. 7 se ðe þæs geswican wille. 7 clænnesse healdan. hæbbe he godes miltse. 7 to worldwurðscipe sy he þegenlaga wyrðe.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">They know full well that they may not rightly marry, and may he who will refrain from that and maintain celibacy enjoy the mercy of God, and as a secular honour be entitled to the rights of a thegn.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
